      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's like you're carrying an immense weight of responsibility, and the burden of your guilt is feeling suffocating. It's not your fault, and you're not a burden to anyone. Everyone's grief is unique, and it's okay to not be the one to bring \"closure\" or \"healing\" to others. Perhaps it's time to focus on your own healing and acceptance, rather than trying to shoulder the weight of the grieving process.",
      "source": "target",
